            "description_html": "<b>Schlage 1-1/8\" Mortise Cylinder Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n1-1/8\" length mortise cylinder with \"Standard Yale\" style cam.  Used on mortise locks and panic device for dogging and alarm control. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with <a href=\"/products/alarm-rim-device-detex-v40eb62836\"><b>DETEX V40EB62836 Alarm Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/alarm-exit-device-pdq-6200r-al\"><b>PDQ 6200R-AL Alarm Exit Device</b></a>, Monarch and Von Duprin panic devices. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Schlage 1-1/8\" Mortise Cylinder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mortise Cylinder Length: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cam: Standard Yale Style</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder Diameter: Standard 1-5/32\" Diameter</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: 6-pin Schlage \"C\" Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: Brushed Chrome, Bright Brass or Oil Rubbed Bronze</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
